WEBVTT

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:30.351
first of all I can't see
through these envelopes.

00:03:30.375 --> 00:03:32.643
They are sealed.
They are thick black envelopes.

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:35.268
You'll know if you wrote one.
I can't see through them.

00:03:35.292 --> 00:03:37.768
Secondly, importantly,
I don't know any of you

00:03:37.792 --> 00:03:39.809
and nobody is playing along.

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:41.458
That's not what this is.

00:03:42.542 --> 00:03:43.792
Thirdly ...

00:03:45.542 --> 00:03:50.309
I don't believe for a second that I have
any special psychological gifts,

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:52.625
let alone any psychic ones.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.000
So let's begin.